# meta::summary = This guide to making a glowstick suggests using protective clothing and mixing hydrogen peroxide and water in one bowl, then luminol, sodium carbonate, copper sulfate, ammonium carbonate (available from websites such as Alfa Aesar or Sigma Aldrich) and water in another, and finally mixing some of both solutions in a bottle to create the glow.
