# meta::summary = This guide on preventing procrastination recommends using a prioritized to-do list with time frames, placed where you can see it, finishing hard stuff first or breaking it down into small parts you can accomplish today, using a timer ('time-boxing') and doing two-minute tasks whenever possible, or doing productive ten-minute work frenzies and ten-minute breaks.
